AdiletCodex - License
======================

Dataset compilation (this dataset: the selection, parsing, article segmentation,
cross-language alignment, and metadata):

  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit (cite the dataset, see README_DATASET.md) and indicate if changes
were made.

Underlying legal texts:
The article texts are official normative legal acts of the Republic of Kazakhstan,
which are public. They were obtained from the official Information and Legal System
adilet.zan.kz. Please retain attribution to adilet.zan.kz. This is an unofficial
research copy; the authoritative, in-force text is the one published on adilet.zan.kz.

The dataset is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
